  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- **Internal support for Compze.Teventive's tevents with identity; nothing public changes:** the tevent store's serializer reads and writes `ITaggregateTeventWithIdentity` tevents, and still leaves out of a tevent's JSON the properties the tevent store keeps in columns of their own, which `TaggregateTeventWithIdentity` now declares. An application that upgrades Compze.Teventive.TeventStore.Abstractions to 0.7.0-alpha must upgrade this package too: the earlier version fails against it at runtime.\n- **Requires newer minor versions of other Compze packages:** Compze.Tessaging 0.10.0-alpha (was 0.9.0-alpha), Compze.Teventive 0.7.0-alpha (was 0.6.0-alpha), Compze.Teventive.TeventStore.Abstractions 0.7.0-alpha (was 0.6.0-alpha). Upgrading to this version upgrades each package listed here too, so their changelogs apply to this upgrade as well.",
